  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "verified-libtommath",
  "excerpt": "Lean 4 proofs that [libtommath](https://github.com/libtom/libtommath) v1.3.0, compiled for bare-metal RV64I (`c/tommath-arith.elf`: xPack GCC 15.2.0, `-O2`, 28-bit digits), is correct: all 100 functions of the image (76 libtommath functions and the 24 newlib/libgcc routines they call: the allocator, `memset`/`memcpy`/`memmove`, 64-bit multiply and divide) meet specifications over Lean's `Int`/`Nat`, as total-correctness triples on the Sail RISC-V model."
 },
